    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Typing Since 3:00 AM",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "horror_whisper",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "3:00 AM · Dorm Group Chat. A gray bubble appears under a name nobody has dared to remove: \"Hannah is typing...\"",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ally",
          "text": "{{player_name}}!! Are you seeing this?! Who got into Hannah’s account?!",
          "timestamp_label": "3:00 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Her mom buried her phone with her. Nobody knows her passcode.",
          "timestamp_label": "3:01 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "threat",
          "text": "You took my silver ring before the police came.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1800,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ally",
          "text": "Did you just see what she unsent?! {{player_name}}, tell me you didn’t keep anything from her desk!",
          "timestamp_label": "3:02 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "threat",
          "duration_sec": 8,
          "transcript": "[muffled breathing under floorboards] ...Give it back, {{player_name}}. It’s so cold down here...",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 900,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Your jewelry box on the nightstand rattles by itself.",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "e1_opt_free",
              "label": "Swear you never touched her ring",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "I swear I didn’t take your ring!",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n08_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "e1_opt_vip",
              "label": "Open the jewelry box right now",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": "Opening my jewelry box...",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Hannah’s status switches to \"Online — 2 meters away.\" Your mattress dips slightly at the foot of the bed.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "SECRET UNLOCKED: Inside lies Hannah’s tarnished silver ring—tucked beside a note in CHLOE’S handwriting: \"Hide it in {{player_name}}’s room.\"",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09_merge",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ally",
          "text": "Wait—the hallway motion light outside YOUR door just turned on! Don’t look under the bed!",
          "timestamp_label": "3:04 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "threat",
          "caller_label": "Hannah (Video Call)",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e1_n11_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e1_n11_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_ans",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "The video feed shows the dark underside of YOUR bedframe—looking straight up at your dangling hand.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_dec",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You slam Decline. Immediately, a cold hand grabs the edge of your blanket from underneath the bed.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n12",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Under the Bedframe",
          "teaser_text": "Episode 2: She isn’t alone—and she knows who really took her ring.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "suspense",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "The Real Thief",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "heartbeat",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "3:05 AM · You leap onto the desk chair, feet off the floor. Your phone buzzes nonstop in the dorm group chat.",
          "style": "time_skip",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "threat",
          "text": "Why did you blame me, Chloe? I saw you slip the ring into {{player_name}}’s drawer.",
          "timestamp_label": "3:05 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Chloe?! YOU planted Hannah’s ring in my room?!",
          "timestamp_label": "3:06 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "threat",
          "duration_sec": 9,
          "transcript": "[pounding on door 302, Chloe screaming] ...Help! The doorknob is freezing—she’s outside MY room now!...",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 900,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "threat",
          "text": "Thank you for telling the truth, {{player_name}}.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ally",
          "text": "Please open your door {{player_name}}! I only took the ring because I owed money! Let me in!!",
          "timestamp_label": "3:08 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Chloe is hammering on your door. In the group chat, Hannah is typing again.",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "e2_opt_free",
              "label": "Slide the silver ring under the door",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Here! Take the ring back!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "e2_opt_vip",
              "label": "Unlock the door to pull Chloe inside",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": "Hold on, I’m opening it!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "The ring slides into the hall and stops dead. Chloe’s screaming cuts off mid-breath.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "SECRET UNLOCKED: You yank the door open—the hallway is empty. On the floor lies Chloe’s phone, still recording the empty stairwell.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Silence settles over the third floor. In the group chat, \"Hannah left the group\" appears—followed one second later by \"Chloe left the group.\"",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "threat",
          "caller_label": "Hannah (Voice Call)",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e2_n11_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e2_n11_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_ans",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Only the soft sound of a silver ring dropping onto a wooden coffin lid—then the line goes dead.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_dec",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You decline. Your phone screen flashes one last message: \"Sleep well, {{player_name}}. Room 302 is vacant now.\"",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n12",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Room 302 Is Vacant",
          "teaser_text": "Season Finale · By morning, the landlord insists nobody named Chloe ever lived on Floor 3.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "suspense",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
